  "id" : "HemOncDoseHelpers",
  "text" : {
    "status" : "extensions",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<div>\n    <table class=\"grid dict\">\n        \n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Title: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">HemOnc dose-computation helpers (BSA, Calvert)</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Id: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">HemOncDoseHelpers</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Version: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">2026-03-12-0.1.0</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Url: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><a href=\"Library-HemOncDoseHelpers.html\">HemOnc dose-computation helpers (BSA, Calvert)</a></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Experimental: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">true</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Type: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                \n                    \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>system: </b> <span><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-library-type.html\">http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/library-type</a></span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>code: </b> <span>logic-library</span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Date: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">2026-03-12</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Publisher: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">HemOnc FHIR Catalog Working Group</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Description: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><div><p>CQL library providing BSA (Mosteller/Du Bois/Haycock), Cockcroft-Gault GFR, Calvert carboplatin formula, and per-sig dose helpers referenced by ActivityDefinition.dynamicValue. Phase 0 spike — covers paclitaxel and carboplatin only. Institution policy (BSA formula, BSA cap, GFR formula, GFR cap) is set via $apply Parameters.</p>\n</div></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Use Context: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                <table class=\"grid-dict\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th><b>code</b></th>\n                        <th><b>value</b></th>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                        <tr>\n                            <td>task</td>\n                            <td/>\n                        </tr>\n                    \n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Jurisdiction: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">DE</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"row\"><b>Parameters: </b></th>\n          <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n            <table class=\"grid-dict\">\n              <tr><th><b>Name</b></th><th><b>Type</b></th><th><b>Min</b></th><th><b>Max</b></th><th><b>In/Out</b></th></tr>\n              \n                <tr><th>BSAFormula</th><th>string</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>In</th></tr>\n              \n                <tr><th>BSACapM2</th><th>decimal</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>In</th></tr>\n              \n                <tr><th>GFRFormula</th><th>string</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>In</th></tr>\n              \n                <tr><th>CarboGFRCapMlMin</th><th>decimal</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>In</th></tr>\n              \n                <tr><th>TargetAUC</th><th>decimal</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>In</th></tr>\n              \n                <tr><th>PaclitaxelDoseMgPerM2</th><th>decimal</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>In</th></tr>\n              \n                <tr><th>PaclitaxelComputedDose</th><th>Quantity</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>Out</th></tr>\n              \n                <tr><th>CarboplatinCalvertDose</th><th>Quantity</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>Out</th></tr>\n              \n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        \n        <tr>\n          <td colspan=\"2\">\n            <table>\n              <tr><th><a id=\"cql-content\"><b>Content: </b></a> text/cql</th></tr>\n              <tr><td><pre><code class=\"language-cql\">library HemOncDoseHelpers version '2026-03-12'\n\nusing FHIR version '4.0.1'\n\ninclude FHIRHelpers version '4.0.1' called FHIRHelpers\n\ncodesystem &quot;SigTargetType&quot;: 'http://hemonc.org/fhir/CodeSystem/sig-target-type'\n\ncode &quot;ComputedFromTargetAUC&quot;:     'computed-from-target-AUC'         from &quot;SigTargetType&quot;\ncode &quot;ComputedFromTargetMgPerM2&quot;: 'computed-from-target-mg-per-m2'   from &quot;SigTargetType&quot;\n\n// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Phase 0 status\n// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// The dose-magnitude computations (Mosteller/Du Bois BSA, Cockcroft-Gault,\n// Calvert) are emitted via FHIRPath dynamicValues in the ActivityDefinition\n// resources, because cqf-fhir 8.4.0 has a bug coercing CQL System.Quantity\n// literals into FHIR.SimpleQuantity at dynamicValue assignment time (surfaces\n// as 'Type org.hl7.fhir.r4.model.DateTimeType is not comparable').\n//\n// This library still owns the *coded* provenance markers — those work fine\n// via text/cql.identifier and are referenced from\n// ActivityDefinition.dynamicValue for the doseAndRate[0].type path.\n//\n// Once the cqf-fhir bug is fixed (track upstream), the dose-magnitude\n// expressions move back into this library and gain real BSA/GFR computation\n// from Patient + Observation context.\n// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\ncontext Patient\n\ndefine DoseAndRateTypeCarboplatin:\n  Concept { codes: { &quot;ComputedFromTargetAUC&quot; } }\n\ndefine DoseAndRateTypePaclitaxel:\n  Concept { codes: { &quot;ComputedFromTargetMgPerM2&quot; } }\n</code></pre></td></tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n        \n        \n    </table>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
